{"type":"standard","title":"Darren Soto","displaytitle":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Darren Soto</span></span>","namespace":{"id":0,"text":""},"wikibase_item":"Q5225162","titles":{"canonical":"Darren_Soto","normalized":"Darren Soto","display":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Darren Soto</span></span>"},"pageid":21099348,"thumbnail":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/93/Darren_Soto_115th_Congress_photo.jpg/330px-Darren_Soto_115th_Congress_photo.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":330,"height":495},"originalimage":{"source":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/93/Darren_Soto_115th_Congress_photo.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","width":1816,"height":2723},"lang":"en","dir":"ltr","revision":"1374308978","tid":"7fc1ac47-ad9f-11f1-8df7-d6641f04ba52","timestamp":"2026-09-11T05:13:18Z","description":"American attorney & politician (born 1978)","description_source":"local","content_urls":{"desktop":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Darren_Soto","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Darren_Soto?action=history","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Darren_Soto?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Darren_Soto"},"mobile":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Darren_Soto","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:History/Darren_Soto","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Darren_Soto?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Darren_Soto"}},"extract":"Darren Michael Soto is an American attorney and politician serving as the U.S. representative for Florida's 9th congressional district since 2017. A member of the Democratic Party, he previously represented the 49th district in the Florida House of Representatives from 2007 to 2012 and the 14th district in the Florida Senate from 2012 to 2016, representing parts of Central Florida.","extract_html":"<p><b>Darren Michael Soto</b> is an American attorney and politician serving as the U.S. representative for Florida's 9th congressional district since 2017. A member of the Democratic Party, he previously represented the 49th district in the Florida House of Representatives from 2007 to 2012 and the 14th district in the Florida Senate from 2012 to 2016, representing parts of Central Florida.</p>"}